This directory is a trimmed copy of kicad-python (https://gitlab.com/kicad/code/kicad-python,
PyPI: kicad-python), module "kipy": only client.py, errors.py and the generated protobuf modules
are kept. The protobuf modules in proto/ were regenerated from this repository's api/proto, which
adds the router commands (RouteTrack, DragTrack, CleanupTracks, RunDrc) that the upstream package
does not have.

